    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d683">

                <pb facs="0753" n="741" sameAs="frus:frus1944v03/pg741"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.01/10–1544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Representative to
                        the French Committee of National Liberation at Paris</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-19T23:00:00-04:00">October 19,
                            1944—11 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>197. Reurtel 18.<anchor n="78" xml:id="d683-f1"/> The President has decided to
                    recognize as the Provisional Government of the French Republic the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> authority <pb facs="0754" n="742"
                        xml:id="pg742"/> established in Paris under the leadership of General de
                    Gaulle, at the time of announcement by the French of the creation of a zone of
                    the interior. Parallel action will be taken by the British Government.</p>
                <p>We assume that Duff Cooper will receive immediate instructions and will inform
                    Bidault.</p>
                <p>Report as soon as possible as to the exact time of the contemplated public
                    announcement by the French of the establishment of the zone of the interior.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
